        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "During this investigation, it was found that hydrazine or dihydrazides in hexamethylphosphoramide react with dicarbonyl chlorides smoothly to give high molecular weight polyhydrazides at room temperature or below. N-Methylpyrrolidone may be used as alternate solvent to give high molecular weight polyhydrazides. This condensation, a low temperature solution (LTS) polymerization, proceeds as shown in eq. (1)."
